{
  "spec": {
    "title": "Web Speech API",
    "url": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "SpeechRecognition/start()",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-start",
      "html": "Start the speech recognition process, directly from a microphone on the device.\n    When invoked, run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>requestMicrophonePermission</var> be a boolean variable set to <code>true</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Run the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#start-session-algorithm\" id=\"ref-for-start-session-algorithm②\">start session algorithm</a> with <var>requestMicrophonePermission</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SpeechRecognition/start(audioTrack)",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-start-audiotrack",
      "html": "Start the speech recognition process, using a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-main/#dom-mediastreamtrack\" id=\"ref-for-dom-mediastreamtrack④\">MediaStreamTrack</a></code>\n    When invoked, run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>audioTrack</var> be the first argument.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>audioTrack</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-main/#dom-mediastreamtrack-kind\" id=\"ref-for-dom-mediastreamtrack-kind\">kind</a></code> attribute is NOT <code>\"audio\"</code>,\nthrow an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror\">InvalidStateError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>audioTrack</var>’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-main/#dom-mediastreamtrack-readystate\" id=\"ref-for-dom-mediastreamtrack-readystate\">readyState</a></code> attribute is NOT\n<code>\"live\"</code>, throw an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror①\">InvalidStateError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>requestMicrophonePermission</var> be <code>false</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Run the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#start-session-algorithm\" id=\"ref-for-start-session-algorithm③\">start session algorithm</a> with <var>requestMicrophonePermission</var> and <var>audioTrack</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SpeechRecognition/available(options)",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-available",
      "html": "When invoked, run these steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>promise</var> be <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#a-new-promise\" id=\"ref-for-a-new-promise\">a new promise</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Run the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#availability-algorithm\" id=\"ref-for-availability-algorithm②\">availability algorithm</a> with <var>options</var> and <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SpeechRecognition/install(options)",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-install",
      "html": "When invoked, run these steps:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>promise</var> be <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#a-new-promise\" id=\"ref-for-a-new-promise①\">a new promise</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-current-settings-object\">current settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-window\" id=\"ref-for-concept-document-window\">associated Document</a> is NOT <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#fully-active\" id=\"ref-for-fully-active\">fully active</a>, reject <var>promise</var> with an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror②\">InvalidStateError</a></code>, abort these steps, returning <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs①\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var> is an empty sequence, resolve <var>promise</var> with <code>false</code>, abort these steps, returning <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If any <var>lang</var> in <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs②\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var> is not a valid <a data-link-type=\"biblio\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#biblio-bcp47\" title=\"Tags for Identifying Languages\">[BCP47]</a> language tag, reject <var>promise</var> with a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror\" id=\"ref-for-syntaxerror\">SyntaxError</a></code>, abort these steps, returning <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If the on-device speech recognition language pack for any <var>lang</var> in <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs③\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var> is unsupported, resolve <var>promise</var> with <code>false</code>, abort these steps, returning <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<span id=\"step-install-transient-activation\"></span>If <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-available\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-available①④\">available()</a></code> would resolve to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable⑨\">\"downloadable\"</a></code> for <var>options</var> (evaluated as if <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally②\">processLocally</a></code> of <var>options</var> were <code>true</code>), that is, if, as far as the calling web page can observe, this call would initiate a download, then:",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p>If the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-current-settings-object①\">current settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global①\">relevant global object</a> does not have <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#transient-activation\" id=\"ref-for-transient-activation②\">transient activation</a>, reject <var>promise</var> with a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notallowederror\" id=\"ref-for-notallowederror①\">NotAllowedError</a></code>, abort these steps, returning <var>promise</var>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#consume-user-activation\" id=\"ref-for-consume-user-activation\">Consume user activation</a> given the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-current-settings-object②\">current settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global②\">relevant global object</a>.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#in-parallel\" id=\"ref-for-in-parallel\">In parallel</a>, run the following steps:",
          "rationale": "abort these steps",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p><span id=\"step-install-download-permission\"></span>The user agent <em class=\"rfc2119\">MAY</em> prompt the user for explicit permission to download the on-device speech recognition language pack(s), or <em class=\"rfc2119\">MAY</em> decline to initiate the download based on implicit signals (such as an observed pattern of abuse; see <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#on-device-model-privacy-availability-installation\">Installation-Time Friction</a>) or storage pressure. <span id=\"req-disk-space\"></span>In the event of storage pressure, user agents <em class=\"rfc2119\">SHOULD</em> balance the utility of on-device speech recognition with the disk space its language packs take up (possibly by declining new downloads or freeing up disk space in other ways, subject to <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#req-download-eviction\">the eviction requirements below</a>; see <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#on-device-model-security-disk-space\">Disk Space for Language Packs</a>), and <em class=\"rfc2119\">MAY</em> involve the user in these decisions (e.g., via the download-time permission prompt or a browser UI for managing downloaded language packs). If the download is not permitted, <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task\">queue a task</a> on the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global③\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue\">task queue</a> to resolve <var>promise</var> with <code>false</code>, and abort these steps.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>For each <var>lang</var> in <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs④\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var>, initiate the download of the on-device speech recognition language pack for <var>lang</var> matching the requested <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality③\">quality</a></code> level floor (if not already installed or downloading).</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p><span id=\"step-install-unmask\"></span>If the download was successfully initiated (or the language pack is already installed or downloading) for every <var>lang</var> in <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs⑤\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var>, set the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state④\">download masking state</a> for (<var>options</var>, <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key①④\">storage key</a>) to \"unmasked\".</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p><span id=\"step-install-fake-download\"></span>Wait for the download of all languages specified by <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs⑥\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var> to either succeed or fail. User agents <em class=\"rfc2119\">MAY</em> artificially fake a download (e.g., by adding a delay before resolving <var>promise</var>) if they believe it would be helpful for privacy reasons, instead of resolving instantly if the language pack is already present (see <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#on-device-model-privacy-sensitive-language\">Sensitive Language Information</a>). During such a fake download, the user agent <em class=\"rfc2119\">MUST</em> report the availability status for that <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key①⑤\">storage key</a> as <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading⑥\">\"downloading\"</a></code> (and treat the language pack as not yet installed for other purposes observable by that <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key①⑥\">storage key</a>, including in the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#start-session-algorithm\" id=\"ref-for-start-session-algorithm④\">start session algorithm</a> and the <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally③\">processLocally</a></code> <code>false</code> branch of the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#availability-algorithm\" id=\"ref-for-availability-algorithm③\">availability algorithm</a>) so that the web page cannot distinguish a fake delay from a real download.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>If the download of all those languages succeeded, let <var>result</var> be <code>true</code>, otherwise let <var>result</var> be <code>false</code>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task①\">Queue a task</a> on the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global④\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue①\">task queue</a> to resolve <var>promise</var> with <var>result</var>.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return <var>promise</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "availability algorithm",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#availability-algorithm",
      "html": "When the  <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"availability-algorithm\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">availability algorithm</dfn> with <var>options</var> and <var>promise</var> is invoked, the user agent MUST run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-current-settings-object③\">current settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global⑤\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-window\" id=\"ref-for-concept-document-window①\">associated Document</a> is NOT <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#fully-active\" id=\"ref-for-fully-active①\">fully active</a>, reject <var>promise</var> with an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror③\">InvalidStateError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>langs</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-langs⑦\">langs</a></code> of <var>options</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If any <var>lang</var> in <var>langs</var> is not a valid <a data-link-type=\"biblio\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#biblio-bcp47\" title=\"Tags for Identifying Languages\">[BCP47]</a> language tag, reject <var>promise</var> with a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror\" id=\"ref-for-syntaxerror①\">SyntaxError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "If <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally①①\">processLocally</a></code> of <var>options</var> is <code>false</code>:",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p>If <var>langs</var> is an empty sequence, let <var>status</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable②\">unavailable</a></code>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Else if speech recognition (which may be remote, or on-device if its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state⑤\">download masking state</a> is \"unmasked\" for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key①⑨\">storage key</a>) is available for all <var>language</var> in <var>langs</var>, let <var>status</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available⑧\">available</a></code>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Else, let <var>status</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable③\">unavailable</a></code>.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "If <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-processlocally①②\">processLocally</a></code> of <var>options</var> is <code>true</code>:",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "If <var>langs</var> is an empty sequence, let <var>status</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable④\">unavailable</a></code>."
            },
            {
              "html": "Else:",
              "rationale": "let",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "html": "Let <var>finalStatus</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available⑨\">available</a></code>."
                },
                {
                  "html": "For each <var>language</var> in <var>langs</var>:",
                  "rationale": "let",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "html": "Let <var>currentLanguageStatus</var>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "If on-device speech recognition for <var>language</var> matching the requested <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality④\">quality</a></code> of <var>options</var> is installed (taking into account <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#req-model-version\">model version limits</a>) and no fake download is in progress for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②⓪\">storage key</a> per <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#step-install-fake-download\">the <code>install()</code> algorithm</a>, set <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available①⓪\">available</a></code>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "Else if on-device speech recognition for <var>language</var> matching the requested <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality⑤\">quality</a></code> of <var>options</var> is currently being downloaded (including a fake download for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②①\">storage key</a> per <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#step-install-fake-download\">the <code>install()</code> algorithm</a>), set <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading⑦\">downloading</a></code>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "Else if on-device speech recognition for <var>language</var> matching the requested <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality⑥\">quality</a></code> of <var>options</var> is supported by the user agent but not yet installed, set <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable①⓪\">downloadable</a></code>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "Else (on-device speech recognition for <var>language</var> is not supported), set <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-unavailable⑤\">unavailable</a></code>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "<span id=\"step-availability-masking\"></span>If <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> is <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-available①①\">available</a></code> or <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloading⑧\">downloading</a></code>, and the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state⑥\">download masking state</a> for (<var>options</var>, <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②②\">storage key</a>) is not \"unmasked\" for <var>language</var>, set <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionavailabilitystatus-downloadable①①\">downloadable</a></code>."
                    },
                    {
                      "html": "If <var>currentLanguageStatus</var> comes after <var>finalStatus</var> in the ordered list <code>[{{SpeechRecognitionAvailabilityStatus/available}}, {{SpeechRecognitionAvailabilityStatus/downloading}}, {{SpeechRecognitionAvailabilityStatus/downloadable}}, {{SpeechRecognitionAvailabilityStatus/unavailable}}]</code>, set <var>finalStatus</var> to <var>currentLanguageStatus</var>."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "html": "Let <var>status</var> be <var>finalStatus</var>."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task②\">Queue a task</a> on the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global⑥\">relevant global object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-service-worker-registration-task-queue②\">task queue</a> to run the following step:</p>\n     <ul>\n      <li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>Resolve <var>promise</var> with <var>status</var>.</p>\n     </li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "start session algorithm",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#start-session-algorithm",
      "html": "When the <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"start-session-algorithm\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">start session algorithm</dfn> with\n<var>requestMicrophonePermission</var> and <var>audioTrack</var> (if provided) is invoked, the user agent MUST run the\nfollowing steps:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#current-settings-object\" id=\"ref-for-current-settings-object④\">current settings object</a>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global\" id=\"ref-for-concept-relevant-global⑦\">relevant global object</a>’s\n <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-window\" id=\"ref-for-concept-document-window②\">associated Document</a> is NOT <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#fully-active\" id=\"ref-for-fully-active②\">fully active</a>, throw an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror④\">InvalidStateError</a></code>\n and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-started-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-started-slot\">[[started]]</a></code> is <code>true</code> and no <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-error\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-error②\">error</a> event or <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-end\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-end③\">end</a> event\nhas fired on it, throw an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror\" id=\"ref-for-invalidstateerror⑤\">InvalidStateError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "If this.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-phrases\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-phrases①\">phrases</a></code>’s <code>length</code> is greater than 0 and the user agent does not support contextual biasing:",
          "rationale": "queue",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task③\">Queue a task</a> to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire\" id=\"ref-for-concept-event-fire\">fire an event</a> named <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-error\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-error③\">error</a> at <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this\">this</a> using <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#speechrecognitionerrorevent\" id=\"ref-for-speechrecognitionerrorevent②\">SpeechRecognitionErrorEvent</a></code> with its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error①\">error</a></code> attribute initialized to <code>phrases-not-supported</code> and its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message①\">message</a></code> attribute set to an implementation-defined string detailing the reason.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Abort these steps.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<span id=\"step-start-local-availability\"></span>Regardless of the value of this.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-processlocally-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-processlocally-slot\">[[processLocally]]</a></code>, the user agent <em class=\"rfc2119\">MUST</em> treat an on-device language pack whose <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state⑦\">download masking state</a> is not \"unmasked\" for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②③\">storage key</a> as not available for local speech recognition. If this.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-processlocally-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-processlocally-slot①\">[[processLocally]]</a></code> is <code>true</code>, or if the user agent otherwise attempts to perform local speech recognition (for example, when remote speech recognition is not supported or not used):",
          "rationale": "if",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "If the user agent determines that local speech recognition is not available for this.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-lang\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-lang②\">lang</a></code> (including when its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state⑧\">download masking state</a> is not \"unmasked\" for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②④\">storage key</a> or when a previously installed language pack was evicted and is no longer usable; see <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#req-download-masking\">the download masking requirements</a> and <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#req-eviction-graceful-failure\">the eviction failure requirements below</a>), or if it cannot fulfill local processing for other reasons (such as <a href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#req-runtime-resources\">preventing resource exhaustion</a>):",
              "rationale": "queue",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task④\">Queue a task</a> to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire\" id=\"ref-for-concept-event-fire①\">fire an event</a> named <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-error\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-error④\">error</a> at <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this①\">this</a> using <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#speechrecognitionerrorevent\" id=\"ref-for-speechrecognitionerrorevent③\">SpeechRecognitionErrorEvent</a></code> with its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error②\">error</a></code> attribute initialized to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorcode-service-not-allowed\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorcode-service-not-allowed③\">service-not-allowed</a></code> and its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message②\">message</a></code> attribute set to an implementation-defined string detailing the reason, which <em class=\"rfc2119\">MUST NOT</em> reveal whether a language pack whose <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#download-masking-state\" id=\"ref-for-download-masking-state⑨\">download masking state</a> is not \"unmasked\" for the caller’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-key\" id=\"ref-for-storage-key②⑤\">storage key</a> is installed or being downloaded.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "html": "<p>Abort these steps.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognition-started-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognition-started-slot①\">[[started]]</a></code> to <code>true</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "If <var>requestMicrophonePermission</var> is <code>true</code> and <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/permissions/#dfn-request-permission-to-use\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-request-permission-to-use\">request permission to use</a> \"<code>microphone</code>\" is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/permissions/#dfn-denied\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-denied\">\"denied\"</a>:",
          "rationale": "queue",
          "steps": [
            {
              "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-task\" id=\"ref-for-queue-a-task⑤\">Queue a task</a> to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire\" id=\"ref-for-concept-event-fire②\">fire an event</a> named <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-error\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-error⑤\">error</a> at <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this②\">this</a> using <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#speechrecognitionerrorevent\" id=\"ref-for-speechrecognitionerrorevent④\">SpeechRecognitionErrorEvent</a></code> with its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-error③\">error</a></code> attribute initialized to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorcode-not-allowed\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorcode-not-allowed①\">not-allowed</a></code> and its <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionerrorevent-message③\">message</a></code> attribute set to an implementation-defined string detailing the reason.</p>"
            },
            {
              "html": "<p>Abort these steps.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Begin consuming audio from the audio source (the <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-main/#dom-mediastreamtrack\" id=\"ref-for-dom-mediastreamtrack⑤\">MediaStreamTrack</a></code> if one was provided, or the microphone otherwise), buffering frames if the recognition service is not yet ready.\nThis establishes the recognition session’s <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled has-dfn-panel\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"session-audio-timeline\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">session audio timeline</dfn>, which measures elapsed audio duration in seconds starting at <code>0.0</code> at the first audio frame consumed and advancing with the duration of each subsequent audio frame consumed.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Once the system is successfully listening to the recognition, queue a task to\n<a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire\" id=\"ref-for-concept-event-fire③\">fire an event</a> named <a class=\"idl-code\" data-link-type=\"event\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#eventdef-speechrecognition-start\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-speechrecognition-start\">start</a> at <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" id=\"ref-for-this③\">this</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SpeechRecognitionPhrase/SpeechRecognitionPhrase(phrase, boost)",
      "href": "https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionphrase-speechrecognitionphrase",
      "html": "When this constructor is invoked, run the following steps:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>boost</var> is smaller than 0.0 or greater than 10.0, throw a <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror\" id=\"ref-for-syntaxerror②\">SyntaxError</a></code> and abort these steps.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>phr</var> be a new object of type <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#speechrecognitionphrase\" id=\"ref-for-speechrecognitionphrase④\">SpeechRecognitionPhrase</a></code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <var>phr</var>.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionphrase-phrase-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionphrase-phrase-slot\">[[phrase]]</a></code> to be the value of <var>phrase</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <var>phr</var>.<code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionphrase-boost-slot\" id=\"ref-for-dom-speechrecognitionphrase-boost-slot\">[[boost]]</a></code> to be the value of <var>boost</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Return <var>phr</var>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}